  "title": "HMI-HUFLAB – A BRAZILIAN - SWEDISH INITIATIVE IN HUMAN FACTORS FOR AERONAUTICS",
  "abstract": "© 2022 ICAS. All Rights Reserved.The HMI-HUFLab project is a joint Brazilian Swedish initiative in the area of human factors and design of human machine interfaces for future military concepts in Aeronautics. This paper gives a short introduction to this Brazilian Swedish collaboration. It describes the main challenges for setting up the bilateral collaboration and how challenges were tackled. We present the first projects results, which includes the definition of relevant context and scenarios for the future air domain, a review of literature and implementation of complementary simulation environments in both countries.",
